<surname>Benz</surname> &#x000a0;<given-names>AP</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Vamos</surname> &#x000a0;<given-names>M</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Erath</surname> &#x000a0;<given-names>JW</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Hohnloser</surname> &#x000a0;<given-names>SH</given-names></string-name></person-group>. <article-title>Cephalic vs. subclavian lead implantation in cardiac implantable electronic devices: a systematic review and meta-analysis</article-title>. <source>Europace</source> &#x000a0;<year>2019</year>;<volume>21</volume>:<fpage>121</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>9</lpage>. <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/europace/euy165</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">30020452</pub-id>
